{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02894","headline":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降 · 任希古","name":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝子陞青陛，王姬降紫宸。\n星光移杂佩，月彩荐重轮。\n龙旌翻地杪，凤管扬天滨。\n槐阴浮浅濑，葆吹翼轻尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"任希古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}